{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"$h(x)$ is the quotient of two, more basic, expressions: $\\cos(x)$ and $\\ln(x)$.\n\nTherefore, the derivative of $h$ can be found using **the quotient rule**:\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\left[\\dfrac{u(x)}{v(x)}\\right]\u0026=\\dfrac{\\dfrac{d}{dx}[u(x)]v(x)-u(x)\\dfrac{d}{dx}[v(x)]}{[v(x)]^2}\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\dfrac{u'(x)v(x)-u(x)v'(x)}{[v(x)]^2}\n\\end{align}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"Let's differentiate!\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}h'(x)\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\left(\\dfrac{\\cos(x)}{\\ln(x)}\\right)\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\dfrac{\\dfrac{d}{dx}(\\cos(x))\\ln(x)-\\cos(x)\\dfrac{d}{dx}(\\ln(x))}{(\\ln(x))^2}\u0026\u0026\\gray{\\text{The quotient rule}}\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\dfrac{-\\sin(x)\\cdot \\ln(x)-\\cos(x)\\cdot\\dfrac1x}{(\\ln(x))^2}\u0026\u0026\\gray{\\text{Differentiate }\\cos(x)\\text{ and }\\ln(x)}\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\dfrac{-x\\sin(x)\\ln(x)-\\cos(x)}{x(\\ln(x))^2}\u0026\u0026\\gray{\\text{Simplify}}\n\\end{align}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"In conclusion,\n\n$h'(x)=\\dfrac{-x\\sin(x)\\ln(x)-\\cos(x)}{x(\\ln(x))^2}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"Let $h(x)=\\dfrac{\\cos(x)}{\\ln(x)}$.\n\n**Find $h'(x)$.**\n\n[[☃ radio 1]]\n","images":{},"widgets":{"radio 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"choices":[{"content":"$\\dfrac{-x\\sin(x)\\ln(x)-\\cos(x)}{x(\\ln(x))^2}$","correct":true},{"content":"$-x\\sin(x)$","correct":false},{"content":"$\\sin(x)-\\dfrac1x$","correct":false,"isNoneOfTheAbove":false},{"content":"$\\dfrac{\\ln(x)\\sin(x)-\\cos(x)}{x\\ln(x)}$","correct":false,"isNoneOfTheAbove":false}],"countChoices":false,"deselectEnabled":false,"displayCount":null,"hasNoneOfTheAbove":false,"multipleSelect":false,"randomize":true},"static":false,"type":"radio","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
